# Matlab Programming Nearest Neighbor Interpolation

![img-11.jpeg](img-11.jpeg)

```matlab
clear all; p=4;
l=imread('lena128.bmp');
[x,y] = size(l);
X=round(x*p); Y=round(y*p);
u=1:1/p:((X-1)/p+1); v=1:1/p:((Y-1)/p+1);
U=round(u); V=round(v);
U(find(U&gt;x))=x; V(find(V&gt;y))=y;
A = l(U,V);
figure(1);imshow(l);
figure(2);imshow(A);
```

