# Matlab Programming Tip

The Matlab function of the interpolation kernel (ricker.m) is provided that can be further extended to array computation.

- x=-3:0.1:3;
- y=-3:0.1:3;
- [X,Y]=ndgrid(x,y);
- Z1=arrayfun(@ricker,X);
- Z2=arrayfun(@ricker,Y);
- Z3=Z1.*Z1;
- figure(1),mesh(Z1);
- figure(2),mesh(Z2);
- figure(3),mesh(Z3);

